%Name = "Shelly Bay"
%MapFile = "ShellyBay.map"

%LevelBriefing = "LUX IT UP

Welcome to Shelly Bay. This used to be a popular getaway for weekenders, but has now been abandoned 
for a while. Fix these old empty shops and restaurants up and create 
a profitable hospital megaplex. Use this oppertunity to show off your money-making skills, you are 
starting with no more than $100 to your name and a loyal skilled researcher from the previous job to get you started. 

Good luck, you might need it."

%LevelDebriefing = "You did it! Impressive. Move on to your next location?"

